<title>USA: Worldcom adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Worldcom adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>WorldCom Inc said Monday it has adopted a shareholder rights plan to discourage a hostile takeover, a move it said was not affected by the recently announced merger with MFS Communications Co Inc.</p>
<p>The plan allows for a dividend distribution of one preferred stock purchase right for each outstanding share of common stock to shareholders of record on September 6.</p>
<p>The plan would be exercised only if an entity acquired 15 percent or more of WorldComm common stock or announced a tender offer that would result in ownership of 15 percent or more of common stock.</p>
</text>
